{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29374","headline":"酬令狐郎中见寄 · 李商隐","name":"酬令狐郎中见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"望郎临古郡，佳句洒丹青。\n应自丘迟宅，仍过柳恽汀。\n封来江渺渺，信去雨冥冥。\n句曲闻仙诀，临川得佛经。\n朝吟搘客枕，夜读漱僧瓶。\n不见衔芦雁，空流腐草萤。\n土宜悲坎井，天怒识雷霆。\n象卉分疆近，蛟涎浸岸腥。\n补羸贪紫桂，负气托青萍。\n万里悬离抱，危於讼合铃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29374.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29374","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}